petabyte | information | =Po, =PB, péta-octet, péta-octets
kilobit | information | =Kb, kbit, kilobit, kilobits
megabit | information | =Mb, mbit, mégabit, mégabits
gigabit | information | =Gb, gbit, gigabit, gigabits

